{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121286","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121286/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121286/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121286/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121286","id":4867627943,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIiIbpw","number":121286,"title":"Raytracing: `has_feature(SUPPORTS_RAY_QUERY)` is always false — `VK_KHR_ray_query` never requested at device creation","user":{"login":"pockerhead","id":28385842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Mzg1ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28385842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead","html_url":"https://github.com/pockerhead","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pockerhead/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-12T15:31:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T16:52:33Z","closed_at":"2026-08-04T16:52:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested Versions\n\nThe bug is reproducible in the official 4.7.stable release\n\n### System Information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 Pro (build 26200) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9621) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-11900K @ 3.50GHz (16 threads) - 31.87 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn hardware that supports ray tracing, `RenderingDevice.has_feature(SUPPORTS_RAYTRACING_PIPELINE)` returns\ntrue, but `has_feature(SUPPORTS_RAY_QUERY)` returns false on the same hardware, where `vulkaninfo` reports full support for `VK_KHR_ray_query`. Apparently, the engine never requests the `rayQuery` functionality when creating a device, so the support bit can never be set to true—the enumeration exists in the public API but is not actually used.\n\nRay query is an inline trace from regular compute/fragment shaders: it does not require a separate RT pipeline with raygen/miss/hit shaders and an SBT table; the shader simply queries for an intersection and receives the result as data. Knowing at runtime that this functionality is supported by the hardware would make this RT API feature usable.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Run MRP on hardware that supports RT (RTX / RDNA2+):\n   ```gdscript\n   var rd := RenderingServer.get_rendering_device()\n   print(rd.has_feature(RenderingDevice.SUPPORTS_RAYTRACING_PIPELINE)) # true\n   print(rd.has_feature(RenderingDevice.SUPPORTS_RAY_QUERY))           # false, always\n   ```\n2. Compare with `vulkaninfo | findstr rayQuery` → `rayQuery = true`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[ray_query_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29941733/ray_query_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121286/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121286/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}